{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40349","headline":"奉试诏用拓拔思恭爲京北收复都统 · 李琪","name":"奉试诏用拓拔思恭爲京北收复都统","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飞骑经巴栈，鸿恩及夏台。\n将从天上去，人自日边来。\n此处金门远，何时玉辇回。\n早平关右贼，莫待诏书催。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李琪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40349.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40349","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}